    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource</strong>\u00a0<strong>Gathering</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect valuable materials in the areas around you  to craft better gears, earn coins,  and slowly expand your enviornment with more functional buildings.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/extras/78283ed865664e7b3fca302916ab3688.poster.avif?t=1755134282\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/extras/78283ed865664e7b3fca302916ab3688.webm?t=1755134282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/extras/78283ed865664e7b3fca302916ab3688.mp4?t=1755134282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dungeon Crawling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a procedurally generated dungeon with difficult enemies, unique weapons, and valuable loot. Fight through enemies and bosses and collect resources to improve your character as you progress the dungeon.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/extras/0b19a775f771c15c4a4bd24074874f56.poster.avif?t=1755134282\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/extras/0b19a775f771c15c4a4bd24074874f56.webm?t=1755134282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/extras/0b19a775f771c15c4a4bd24074874f56.mp4?t=1755134282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Horde Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on waves of enemies in a chaotic environment. Survive as long as possible, defeat increasingly difficult enemies, and spend your resources wisely to strengthen your character.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/extras/18e6dd26baec1035e0494a6eef5e5c0c.poster.avif?t=1755134282\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/extras/18e6dd26baec1035e0494a6eef5e5c0c.webm?t=1755134282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/extras/18e6dd26baec1035e0494a6eef5e5c0c.mp4?t=1755134282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Farming &amp; Fishing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm and fish in a peaceful environment. Taking a break from combat to relax, gather resources, and manage your land at your own pace.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/extras/91b8bae6408839884ab13af40990d33a.poster.avif?t=1755134282\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/extras/91b8bae6408839884ab13af40990d33a.webm?t=1755134282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/extras/91b8bae6408839884ab13af40990d33a.mp4?t=1755134282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Upgrade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your character over time by enhancing stats, unlocking new abilities, and upgrading tools/weapons through anything and everything in the game, whether it\u2019s farming, fishing, material gathering or dungeon crawling. Everything contributes to growth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/extras/cec9650547385d264bb1f055c0795ace.poster.avif?t=1755134282\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/extras/cec9650547385d264bb1f055c0795ace.webm?t=1755134282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/extras/cec9650547385d264bb1f055c0795ace.mp4?t=1755134282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to grow your crops and conquer the chamber?</strong></p>",
