lay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/extras/cec9650547385d264bb1f055c0795ace.poster.avif?t=1755134282\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/extras/cec9650547385d264bb1f055c0795ace.webm?t=1755134282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443250/extras/cec9650547385d264bb1f055c0795ace.mp4?t=1755134282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to grow your crops and conquer the chamber?</strong></p>",
